10
00:00:39,442 --> 00:00:41,782
(Penny:)Yeah, it's...
it's a little blurry,

11
00:00:41,877 --> 00:00:43,717
(Raj:)but I think that works in your favour.

12
00:00:44,814 --> 00:00:46,814
(Raj:)-Do you want a beer?
-Sure.

13
00:00:46,949 --> 00:00:49,489
(Stuart:)Hey, have you finished writing
your profile yet?

14
00:00:49,552 --> 00:00:50,552
